WEBVTT

NOTE The JESUS Film (1979), ch. 26 Teaching About Prayer and Faith (Arclight 1_jf6126-0-0), en.
NOTE Timings: whisper.cpp small -dtw small per speech burst on the isolated dialogue (dialoguenhance centre channel), first word on the burst start, 2026-11-06.

1
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:03.100
Ask, and you will receive;

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.000
seek, and you will find;

3
00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:10.550
knock, and the door will be opened to you.

4
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.250
For everyone who asks will receive,

5
00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:16.650
and he who seeks will find,

6
00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:20.400
and the door will be opened to anyone who knocks.

7
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:31.400
Would any of you who are fathers give to your son

8
00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:33.600
a snake when he asks for a fish,

9
00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:36.550
or a scorpion when he asks for an egg?

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.100
As bad as you are, you know how to give good things to your children.

11
00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:49.050
How much more, then, will the Heavenly Father give the Holy Spirit to those who ask Him.
